---
layout: base.njk
title: "Website Tips & Insights for UK Small Businesses"
description: "Website tips and insights for UK small businesses. Practical guides on SEO, performance and strategy written in plain English to help your business grow online."
date: 2026-02-01
---

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="py-24 text-center relative overflow-hidden bg-bg-primary dark:bg-bg-primary-dark">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark leading-tight pt-6">Practical insights for growing your business online</h1>
            <p class="text-lg mb-8 text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto text-left">
                At CodeCraft North, we believe your website should be more than a digital brochure, it should be a tool that drives growth. Our resources are written for small business owners who want clear, actionable advice without the jargon.
            </p>
            <div class="mb-8 flex justify-center">
                <div class="w-full max-w-md min-w-0">
                    {% image "./src/img/resources.svg", "Website tips and insights for UK small businesses", [400, 800, 1200], "w-full h-auto max-w-full rounded-lg" %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Topics Section -->
<section class="py-16 bg-bg-section dark:bg-bg-section-dark">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Browse our latest articles, guides and case studies covering:
        </p>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-lg text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-primary-on-dark shrink-0 mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>Website performance and SEO fundamentals</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-primary-on-dark shrink-0 mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>Choosing between subscription and one-off builds</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-primary-on-dark shrink-0 mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>Best practices for content, hosting and maintenance</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-primary-on-dark shrink-0 mt-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span>Tools and strategies to help your business grow</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">
            Whether you're just starting out or looking to improve an existing site, you'll find something useful here.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Blog Posts Section -->
<section class="py-16 bg-bg-primary dark:bg-bg-primary-dark">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-4 text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark leading-tight">Latest Articles</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark">Explore our most recent insights and how-tos.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            {% for post in collections.posts %}
            <article class="bg-bg-surface dark:bg-bg-surface-dark rounded-xl shadow-lg border border-border-standard dark:border-border-standard-dark overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
                <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="block">
                    {% if post.data.image %}
                    <div class="aspect-video bg-bg-card dark:bg-bg-card-dark overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }} - CodeCraft North article" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="800" height="450">
                    </div>
                    {% else %}
                    <div class="aspect-video bg-linear-to-br from-brand-primary to-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center">
                        <svg class="w-16 h-16 text-white opacity-50" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    
                    <div class="p-6">
                        {% if post.data.category %}
                        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-text-primary dark:text-brand-primary bg-brand-light rounded-full mb-3">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
                        {% endif %}
                        
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark leading-tight hover:text-brand-primary dark:hover:text-brand-primary-on-dark transition-colors">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
                        
                        {% if post.data.excerpt %}
                        <p class="text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark mb-4 leading-relaxed">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                        
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark">
                            <time datetime="{{ post.data.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</time>
                            <span class="text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-primary-on-dark font-medium">Read more</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

